犹如神柱般屹立于他面前的巨人，仿佛有他在，所有的艰难险阻都能轻易跨过。慕寒遥冷然转身，朝着凤傲天单膝跪地，不卑不亢，“草民斗胆敢问摄政王因何召草民前来？”玑柏抬眸，与众将领注视着身前那挺拔的背影，透过耀眼的烛光，更显威严，他们适才坍塌的高山如今再次立于他们面前，似是经历千年，亦是永不倒塌。凤傲天心中满意浅笑，她果然没看错人，遇到如今境界，他竟然能如此沉稳有度，表现的这般大气凛然，可知他内心隐忍力的强大已经达到一个不可超越的极限，但，却并未达到凤傲天心中的满意度。不过，来日方长，如今，正是好时机，是生是死，全凭他的决定。“玑中郎，依着李校尉今日如此张狂之言，对社稷不忠，对本王不敬者，按照军规，应当如何处置？”凤傲天一手抚摸着手中的暖玉，另一手臂自然垂于一侧，凤眸冷沉，面带冷厉。玑柏听闻之后，猛然抬眸，正巧撞上凤傲天射来的凌冽眼神，垂眸，如实回道，“按律当斩，灭其九族。”“若是旁观者，并未阻拦，任由其言，该当何罪？”凤傲天如玉纤细的手指划过暖玉，一抹冰凉冷光映照与玑柏脸上。玑柏顿时脸色一白，心神一颤，低声道，“但凡牵连着，皆处以绞刑，其家眷发配北极苦寒之地，永不得入境。”“慕寒遥，你如今虽革去了将军之职，但，亦是慕家军之首领，此事，你亦是难辞其咎。”凤傲天肃然起身，步履悠闲行至慕寒遥面前，冷漠俊朗的容颜镀上一层嗜血的寒光，“这九族之内，亦是包括你等，这慕府必定是首当其冲。”慕寒遥眸光冷沉，垂眸，掩去心中怒意，更多的却是羞愧，慕家百年英明，决不能毁在他的手上，“摄政王若是当真下令如此，草民同其家眷必定遵旨，不过，如今战事在即，未免军心动荡，敌军随时有机可趁，草民恳请摄政王可否暂缓行刑？”“末将等恳请摄政王暂缓行刑！”玑柏等人见此，齐齐乞求道。凤傲天嘴角溢出一抹不易察觉的得逞笑意，随即沉声道，“你是想拿边关安危，让本王网开一面吗？”“正是。”慕寒遥沉声应道。“慕寒遥，本王从不知何为网开一面，若是想要让本王改变决定，你要拿出诚意才是。”凤傲天嘴角倾斜，“你应当知晓本王的心思。”慕寒遥眸光紧皱，着实不明白这摄政王到底打何主意？寒瑾已被他侮辱，难道，连他也要沦落至此吗？那么，他在军中还有何威严？即便是网开一面，那他还有何颜面面对列祖列宗？如何问心无愧地面对与他出生入死的将士？李肃与玑柏顿时面色一寒，这……他们连忙抬眸，将目光落在慕寒遥身上，相继做了一个手势，若是当真到无法挽回的局势，那么，他们便顾不得其他，即便杀了摄政王，凤国亦是有皇上在位，虽然年幼，但，只要他们誓死戍守边关，待到幼皇成年，他们依旧是忠君报国的慕家军。慕寒遥却知晓凤傲天的武功，适才，他便能如此轻易将自己制服，便知他的武功高深莫测，杀他，谈何容易。凤傲天见慕寒遥沉默不语，一眼飘过玑柏等人，他们私下的动作，更是尽收眼底，他冷笑一声，抬起手臂，冲天打起一个响指，“既然你不愿意，本王自然不会强人所难，本王饲养与林中的宝贝如今可是饥寒交迫的紧，迫切需要食物，你若不愿当本王的人，那本王便将你赏给它们好了。”她冷冷说罢，眸底射出慑人杀意，魂魄二人随即飞身落于营帐内，脚未沾地，慕寒遥已被他们二人架起闪身离开。玑柏等人顿时一惊，李肃更是大惊失色，想起树林中的惨象，连忙喊道，“不好，将军如今怕是已经被带入五里之外的树林中，那里有狼群。”“摄政王，若是将军有何不测，末将等必定会随将军而去。”玑柏向众人递着眼色，一面向凤傲天大胆直言，一面已经渐渐地拔出腰间的佩刀。－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－嗷呜……冷酷将军VS摄政王，嘿嘿……", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/yetaicanbao/9.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Volume 1 Regency 009 You should know what this king is thinking. Feng Aotian glanced coldly at the generals kneeling at her feet, as well as Mu Hanyao, who always stood proudly in front of her, motionless. Some people don't need flattery, no need to beg for mercy, and no need to be flattering. He is like a black iron sword that has been trained for thousands of years. Only after being hammered and struck again, and reborn from the ashes, will it become even sharper and invincible. Mu Hanyao is such a good sword. He has the belief that he can stand firm and survive. That is the glory of the Mu family army that made him wait until death, and the oath to be loyal to the emperor and serve the country. Who doesn't know the loyalty of Mu Jiajun, and who doesn't admire Mu Jiajun's determination to protect his family and country to the death? In their eyes, Feng Aotian was just a stupid king who had killed countless people and was licentious and immoral. They naturally disdained him and would not be convinced by him. They were loyal to the proud Mu family army, and they were even more loyal to the general Mu Hanyao who had been with them through life and death. Now, the regent who was supposed to be scorned by them and eager to kill him, actually spoke with such contempt towards them. It was as if he was driving them completely into hell. The bone-eroding cold hit their whole bodies, and all the generals were trembling. \"General, it's the last general who deserves to die.\" Li Su's face was ashen as he kowtowed to Mu Hanyao repeatedly. He lowered his head and glanced at the sword that he had worn for many years and killed countless enemies with him. He raised his palm and patted his Tianling Cap. A gust of cold wind passed by. Mu Hanyao was still naked. He knocked off Li Su's palm with a sharp slap and shouted coldly, \"The soldiers of the Mu family army will never be so cowardly. They would rather die on the battlefield than die in their own hands.\" Li Su endured it. Feeling regret, he raised his eyes and stared into Mu Hanyao's resolute eyes. Although he was not naked now, he looked like a giant wearing silver armor, standing in front of him like a divine pillar. It seemed that with him, he could easily overcome all difficulties and obstacles. Mu Hanyao turned around coldly and knelt down on one knee towards Feng Aotian, neither humble nor arrogant, \"How dare the common people ask the regent why he called the common people here?\" Ji Bai raised his eyes and stared at the tall back in front of him with the other generals. Through the dazzling candlelight, it became even more majestic. The mountain they had just collapsed now stood in front of them again, as if it had experienced thousands of years and would never collapse. Feng Aotian smiled with satisfaction in his heart. She had indeed seen the right person. In his current state, he could be so calm and measured, and behaved in such a majestic manner. This showed that his inner endurance had reached an insurmountable limit, but it did not reach Feng Aotian's satisfaction. However, there is a long time to come, and now is a good time. Life or death depends entirely on his decision. \"Mr. Ji Zhong, according to Captain Li's arrogant words today, those who are disloyal to the country and disrespectful to the king, according to military regulations, how should they be dealt with?\" Feng Aotian stroked the warm jade in his hand with one hand, and the other arm naturally hung to one side. Feng Aotian's eyes were cold and his face was cold and stern. After hearing this, Ji Bai suddenly raised his eyes, and happened to meet Feng Aotian's stern eyes. He lowered his eyes and replied truthfully, \"I will kill him according to the law and destroy his nine tribes.\" \"If I am a bystander and do not stop him, but let him speak, what crime should he be guilty of?\" Feng Aotian's jade-like slender fingers crossed the warm jade, and a cold light shone on Ji Bai's face. Ji Bai's face suddenly turned pale, his mind trembled, and he whispered, \"Anyone involved will be hanged, and his family members will be sent to the bitter cold land of the Arctic and will never be allowed to enter.\" \"Mu Hanyao, although you have been dismissed from the position of general, you are also Mu Hanyao. Leader of the family army, you are also responsible for this matter.\" Feng Aotian stood up solemnly and walked leisurely in front of Mu Hanyao. His cold and handsome face was coated with a bloodthirsty cold light, \"These nine clans also include you, this Mu Mansion. He must be the first to bear the brunt.\" Mu Hanyao's eyes were cold and he lowered his eyes, hiding the anger in his heart. What was more, he was ashamed. The Mu family's century-old wisdom must not be ruined in his hands. \"If the regent really orders this, the common people and his family will suffer. We must comply with the order, but now that the war is imminent, the morale of the army will be unstable, and the enemy may take advantage of it at any time. Can the civilians ask the regent to postpone the execution? \"\" The general and others are pleading to the regent to postpone the execution!\" Seeing this, Jibai and others begged. An imperceptible smile of success overflowed from the corner of Feng Aotian's lips, and then he said in a deep voice, \"Are you trying to limit the safety of the king and allow me to keep the situation open?\" \"Exactly.\" Mu Hanyao responded in a deep voice. \"Mu Hanyao, I have never known what it means to be open-minded. If you want me to change my decision, you have to show sincerity.\" Feng Aotian's mouth tilted, \"You should know what I am thinking.\" Mu Hanyao's eyes were wrinkled, and he really didn't understand what the regent had planned? Han Jin has been insulted by him, will he also be reduced to this? So, what dignity does he have in the military? Even if the net is open to one side, how can he have the face to face his ancestors? How to face the soldiers who fought with him through life and death with a clear conscience? Li Su and Ji Bai's expressions suddenly turned cold. This... They quickly raised their eyes, set their sights on Mu Hanyao, and made gestures one after another. If the situation was serious enough to be irreversible, then they would not care about anything else. Even if they killed the regent, the Feng Kingdom would still have an emperor on the throne. Although they were young, as long as they defended the border to the death, and until the young emperor came of age, they would still be the Mu family army loyal to the emperor and serving the country. Mu Hanyao knew Feng Aotian's martial arts. Just now, he was able to subdue him so easily, so he knew that his martial arts were unpredictable and killing him was not easy. When Feng Aotian saw that Mu Hanyao was silent, he glanced at Ji Bai and the others, and had a panoramic view of their private movements. He sneered, raised his arms, and snapped his fingers in the sky, \"Since you don't want to, I will not force anyone to do anything. The treasures I raise in the forest are now hungry and cold, and are in urgent need of food. If you don't want to be my man, then", "title_en": "Chapter 9"}